cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ggufkit in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "ggufkit: fingerprint, verify and visualize GGUF models"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Perikov
    given-names: Konstantin
  - alias: KerfuffleV2
    name: Kerfuffle
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-10-28"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/MysterionRise/ggufkit"
keywords:
  - gguf
  - llama.cpp
  - quantization
  - provenance
  - model signing
abstract: >-
  ggufkit gives GGUF model files an order-independent content fingerprint, a provenance
  manifest that records what a file claims and what it leaves out, verification against either,
  and images of quantization error and quantization recipes.
